prompt Keaton asked for the next agent-doable lap, Lindy-first crux-first, picking up the running thread from the newest log's recommend line, with reds closed first and the round sent as its own signed increment.
think Standfast first -- every living row in crux/REDS.md reads CLOSED or Released, so no red preempts constructive work this lap.
think The running thread is the Caravan quarrel arc. The newest log's recommend named the crux plainly: a finding lands in the reader's box and the arc asks them nothing, so a plan may put work right, tell the person who asked, and never learn whether it settled the thing.
think Council rota, lap index 81 mod 27 -> item 27: deep-read recursion-prompts/README.md -- the balance compass (Radiant, Twilight, TAME, CIVIC, compass rose, Lindy-first crux-first, reds-first) held in one page, and the discipline that a prompt rewards finished, proven, bounded work.
think Named the rung suffice under the Comlink tendency -- a plain warm word, free in the tree by grep, clear on first meeting and safe against every seated name.
think Layered it the way the arc grows: suffice.rye imports apprise.rye as the rung below, every wrapped tally moves one tier in, and a new apprise_of accessor seats the tier the file used to own directly.
think Shaped the value model on deem rather than on apprise -- the word comes off the wire in the reader's own hand and is published where the outcome is read, because a supervisor able to author its reader's satisfaction has graded its own answer.
think Chose four bytes for the reader's word: the three carried to them echoed back exactly, and one more saying what they make of it, so a verdict left over from an earlier look can never be read as today's.
think Made both measured runs apprise, so the rung below stands still and only the asking parts them -- and seated the reader's own word on the wire under both runs, so the unasking plan is not blocked from learning, it simply never looks.
obs unweighed_in collided with a heed-tier function of the same name inherited from the rungs below; renamed this rung's half to unasked_in, which reads truer beside the Suffice enum anyway.
obs Two probes needed a Zig-shaped plant rather than a plain constant: forcing matched false left a local unused, so the plant became `and false`, and skipping the write left `worth` unused, so the plant kept one trivial read.
obs The reader of this lap says the answer falls short, on purpose, and the plan still settles carried out whole. A reader's dissatisfaction is a fact an operator is owed rather than a verdict on the work.
